{"unit_id":"elong16__dsh-skin-xuyuanwu#card-zh","repo":"elong16/dsh-skin-xuyuanwu","commit":"418c54866d1d9861838546746902cc16a7bf9708","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**许愿屋（dsh-skin-xuyuanwu）**（DSH Web 插件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 换上暖灯小屋与星空主题。它通过 Web 客户端的品牌槽位替换侧栏标志、名称和首屏徽章，并以主题令牌和可配置 CSS 为界面加入琥珀配色、背景月相、星群、流星及开场动画。主要功能还包括输入回车触发许愿流星、月亮彩蛋与许愿签、AI 生成时的灯光呼应、打字萤火、原生合成音效和快捷设置面板。适合希望个性化 DSH Web 外观并增添轻量交互动效的用户。需要支持相应 DSH Web 插件接口的环境；没有额外 API Key 或外部账号配置，面板偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2679-2795","cordis.patch.yml:30-55"]}
{"unit_id":"elong16__dsh-skin-xuyuanwu#card-en","repo":"elong16/dsh-skin-xuyuanwu","commit":"418c54866d1d9861838546746902cc16a7bf9708","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**Wish House** themes the DSH web client with an amber palette, custom sidebar branding, and an animated night sky. It adds moon phases, stars, meteor effects, wish toasts, typing sparks, and a settings panel that stores preferences in browser localStorage. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2679-2795","cordis.patch.yml:30-55"]}
