{"unit_id":"elong16__dsh-skin-xuyuanwu#feature-2","repo":"elong16/dsh-skin-xuyuanwu","commit":"418c54866d1d9861838546746902cc16a7bf9708","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**许愿屋** 的功能「星空月相背景」：在页面背景加入星空贴片、灯晕、月亮和缓动月相，另可显示星群与流星。插件启用对应配置开关后随 Web 页面加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2718-2728","lib/client.js:2742-2745"]}
