{"unit_id":"elong16__dsh-skin-xuyuanwu#feature-4","repo":"elong16/dsh-skin-xuyuanwu","commit":"418c54866d1d9861838546746902cc16a7bf9708","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**许愿屋** 的功能「快捷手札设置」：点击侧栏的设置触发区可打开面板，勾选音效、月相、萤火等开关并保存到浏览器 localStorage，重置后刷新页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2483-2596","lib/client.js:2788-2790"]}
